# Front-end coverage run (src/xbox/PUSH-BC-PLAN.md section 5.10, C-EMIT):
# the title, the front-end menus and their cartridge transitions, the
# keyboard, a level load (the loading screen) and the first seconds of a
# match: the drawing sources the arcade scripts pass through only briefly.
# For TS_NATIVE_EMIT_SELFCHECK runs (emitdiff = 0) and screenshots with the
# emitter knobs on and off (make AUTOPLAY=src/xbox/test/frontend.pad).
#
# The menu path is arcade-match.pad's with every idle stretched to at
# least 60 reads, so each page's cartridge transition runs to its end and
# the page is drawn settled before the next input.
#
# Format (ps2_pad.cpp):
#   <reads> <buttons> [lx ly rx ry]
#   wait_u32 <guest-address> <comparison> <value>

